        ("worth-it", "Is It Worth It?", """<h2>Is a Bosphorus Dinner Cruise Worth It?</h2><p>Yes, if you want dinner and a show in one evening: three hours on the water past <strong>Dolmabahçe Palace, Ortaköy Mosque and the lit Bosphorus Bridge</strong>, a meze and grill dinner and a Turkish night show cost <strong>€17 to €30</strong> a person before drinks.</p><p>It is not a gourmet meal. The menus are set and similar from boat to boat; you book for the view, the show and the atmosphere. If you want to eat well first and foremost, eat on land and take a sunset ferry.</p>"""),
